      "offsetInSection": 1416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bravo, je vois que tu as réussi à capturer\nl’Aspicot Baron !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007200610076006F002C0020006A006500200076006F0069007300200071007500650020007400750020006100730020007200E90075007300730069002000E0002000630061007000740075007200650072000A006C201900410073007000690063006F00740020004200610072006F006E00200021001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mes arbustes devraient être tranquilles,\ndésormais.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065007300200061007200620075007300740065007300200064006500760072006100690065006E0074002000EA0074007200650020007400720061006E007100750069006C006C00650073002C000A006400E90073006F0072006D006100690073002E001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est étrange...\nJe suis soulagé, mais je ressens comme un vide.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSerait-ce parce que... je me suis habitué à courir\naprès ces Aspicot au quotidien... ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 159
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dis-moi, jeune <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЄhommfille...\nAccepterais-tu de me donner l’Aspicot Baron ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien sûr, il est à vous !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E0020007300FB0072002C00200069006C0020006500730074002000E000200076006F00750073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je préfère le garder à mes côtés.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200070007200E9006600E8007200650020006C00650020006700610072006400650072002000E00020006D006500730020006300F4007400E90073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça alors ! Vu de près, son aiguillon empoisonné\nest impressionnant !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C7006100200061006C006F007200730020002100200056007500200064006500200070007200E80073002C00200073006F006E002000610069006700750069006C006C006F006E00200065006D0070006F00690073006F006E006E00E9000A00650073007400200069006D007000720065007300730069006F006E006E0061006E007400200021001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aspicot et moi, on est partis du mauvais pied...\nMais notre amour pour ce jardin nous a réunis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vais lui demander de protéger ce jardin, et je\nlui donnerai de délicieuses feuilles en échange !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nMerci pour tout, jeune <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЄhommfille !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je comprends. L<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿଊe Dresseura Dresseuse que tu es\nsera sûrement plus à même de s’occuper<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde lui que moi, simple jardinier.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’Aspicot Baron m’aide à protéger ce jardin\nen tenant les autres Aspicot à l’écart !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
